Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Jenkins Service Won't Start
Symptoms: Jenkins service fails to start or stops unexpectedly.

Solutions:

# Check Java installation
java -version

# Check Jenkins service logs
sudo journalctl -u jenkins -f

# Restart Jenkins service
sudo systemctl restart jenkins

# Check port availability
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 8080
Issue 2: Git Repository Access Issues
Symptoms: Jenkins cannot clone or access the Git repository.

Solutions:

# Verify Git configuration
git config --list

# Test repository access manually
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/jenkins-integration-demo.git test-clone

# Check Jenkins user permissions
sudo -u jenkins git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/jenkins-integration-demo.git
Issue 3: Build Failures
Symptoms: Jenkins builds fail with various errors.

Solutions:

# Check Node.js installation in Jenkins
# Go to Manage Jenkins > Global Tool Configuration > NodeJS

# Verify build script syntax
bash -n your-build-script.sh

# Check workspace permissions
sudo chown -R jenkins:jenkins /var/lib/jenkins/workspace/
Issue 4: Polling Not Working
Symptoms: Jenkins doesn't detect Git changes automatically.

Solutions:

Verify SCM polling configuration in job settings
Check Jenkins system clock synchronization
Review Git repository URL format
Ensure proper branch specification
